# Google Places API key (Places API (New)). Create one at
# https://console.cloud.google.com/apis/library/places.googleapis.com
# Enable "Places API (New)", then create an API key and restrict it to that API.
# The free monthly allowance (5,000 Pro + 1,000 Enterprise calls) covers
# personal use — each search is one Enterprise call. Without a key, the app
# serves fun demo data.
GOOGLE_PLACES_API_KEY=
